### [GET] Search by title — returns results with posters only
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search?query=inception

### [GET] Search with pagination — page 2
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search?query=batman&page=2

### [GET] Search title with spaces
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search?query=the dark knight

### [GET] Missing query param → 400
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search

### [GET] Empty query string → 400
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search?query=

### [GET] Query too long (>100 chars) → 400
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search?query=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

### [GET] No results found → 404
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search?query=xzxzxzxzxzxzxzxzxzxznomatch99999

### [GET] Page out of range → uses default page 1
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/search?query=inception&page=999